		<preamble GUID="_c531bcbd-709b-4f60-aeef-4929cbedc488" eId="preamble">
			<?DMS-Component componentId="001d9fe2-c79e-4e29-8d12-15eb5bbc6a70" seriesId="cc5baa9e-d68b-454b-8487-563d645d66b9" versionNumber="0"?>
			<formula GUID="_2003957b-6607-46d8-bba8-fd8103d5fc68" eId="preamble__enactingWords" name="enactingText">
				<p>The Secretary of State makes this <ref class="placeholder" href="#varDocSubType" /> in exercise of the powers conferred by section 24(2A) of the Petroleum Act 1998<authorialNote GUID="_b62d0a9e-3e63-4467-b6e0-07f640986656" class="footnote" eId="fnote_1" marker="1">
					<p>1998 c. 17. Subsection (2A) was inserted into section 24 by paragraph 7(2) of Schedule 8 to the Marine and Coastal Access Act 2009 (c. 23).</p>
					</authorialNote> and sections 2(4)(e) and 7(1) of the Energy Act 2008<authorialNote GUID="_7fc8dd08-f489-4a6d-b182-c3d740d439bc" class="footnote" eId="fnote_3" marker="3">
					<p>2008 c. 32.</p>
					</authorialNote>.</p>
				<p>The Secretary of State has consulted the Oil and Gas Authority in accordance with section 25(1)(a) of the Petroleum Act 1998 and section 7(4) of the Energy Act 2008.</p>
			</formula>
			<p />
		</preamble>
		<body>
			<?DMS-Component componentId="cd831fd8-35d8-4fce-9846-2e2e5cd206b8" seriesId="0597a705-b0da-442e-a2d9-b9ce44c1fa0f" versionNumber="1"?>
			<part GUID="_2b7c8c25-4b3c-4978-bb91-2e70a64c6038" class="group2" eId="pt_1">
				<?DMS-Component componentId="64a6912d-989d-46dd-b58e-21f7689b26b5" seriesId="9f4500c2-dc8e-49eb-9131-0c36199235bb" versionNumber="0"?>
				<num>Part 1</num>
				<heading GUID="_49fe489b-7d61-4b75-9a86-169c1db3369e" eId="pt_1__hdg">Preliminary</heading>
				<article GUID="_33db8435-baae-47b9-a9d9-1c002dd06725" class="prov1" eId="art_1">
					<?DMS-Component componentId="4a2897e9-7400-4d8f-8b77-43814021bd1c" seriesId="60151d56-422a-4d39-9e87-129ecf0846cf" versionNumber="0"?>
					<heading GUID="_a3c38fe8-be21-471d-9be9-754e8925c039" eId="art_1__hdg">Citation and commencement</heading>
					<num>1.</num>
					<paragraph GUID="_f874698f-3a9b-453a-a056-af662d74f13d" class="prov2" eId="art_1__para_1">
						<num>(1)</num>
						<content>
							<p>These Regulations may be cited as the Petroleum Act 1998 (Specified Pipelines) (Amendment) and Importation and Storage of Combustible Gas (Designation of Substance etc.) Order 2023.</p>
						</content>
					</paragraph>
					<paragraph GUID="_13f01f6b-ad3a-497f-a174-82e00af94359" class="prov2" eId="art_1__para_2">
						<num>(2)</num>
						<content>
							<p>These Regulations come into force on 27th September 2023.</p>
						</content>
					</paragraph>
				</article>
			</part>
			<part GUID="_6fd926b1-6185-447e-9741-c91bec3bf534" class="group2" eId="pt_2">
				<?DMS-Component componentId="f9f57636-454f-4451-84ce-a3326403c855" seriesId="4521791e-a836-4bda-98b4-47fddca21602" versionNumber="0"?>
				<num>Part 2</num>
				<heading GUID="_b59f82ed-7a65-44a5-870a-edf62231683a" eId="pt_2__hdg">Pipe-lines</heading>
				<article GUID="_36e9b522-054d-42c1-bf39-98cb5c5b1571" class="prov1" eId="art_2">
					<?DMS-Component componentId="0a6252b2-3fd7-47bf-b10e-de2c26ca35bc" seriesId="28e39fe4-18fa-4346-b827-16bf367fca09" versionNumber="0"?>
					<heading GUID="_b55a6779-fd27-4968-8d09-fb871ee41e6e" eId="art_2__hdg">Amendment to The Petroleum Act 1998 (Specified Pipelines) Order 2011</heading>
					<num>2.</num>
					<paragraph GUID="_308f901b-20a2-42fe-86e8-24e9ae0e9128" class="prov2" eId="art_2__para_1">
						<num>(1)</num>
						<content>
							<p>The Petroleum Act 1998 (Specified Pipelines) Order 2011<authorialNote GUID="_244d6a91-7f26-4657-93e7-92c0575fe29e" class="footnote" eId="fnote_4" marker="4">
								<p>S.I. 2011/423.</p>
								</authorialNote> is amended as follows.</p>
						</content>
					</paragraph>
					<paragraph GUID="_e907ba51-7531-4c8f-aea9-2cfd3627d158" class="prov2" eId="art_2__para_2">
						<num>(2)</num>
						<intro GUID="_628b1b43-8aaa-4c55-a866-3c3d0d72d0ab" eId="art_2__para_2__intro">
							<p>In article 2 (Specified pipelines)—</p>
						</intro>
						<level GUID="_f785572e-d5cd-4142-9c35-25f06e8d9cca" class="para1" eId="art_2__para_2__para_a">
							<num>(a)</num>
							<content>
								<p>in paragraph 2(b) after “substances;” omit “or”;</p>
							</content>
						</level>
						<level GUID="_9593a187-81b6-43a3-ae22-1120c4d3d910" class="para1" eId="art_2__para_2__para_b">
							<num>(b)</num>
							<content>
								<p>in paragraph 2(c) for “substances.” substitute “substances; or”; </p>
							</content>
						</level>
						<level GUID="_316f2af0-b642-4d7c-8de7-414879522d11" class="para1" eId="art_2__para_2__para_c">
							<num>(c)</num>
							<content>
								<p> <mod>after paragraph 2(c) insert—<quotedStructure GUID="_676b2de8-f3b9-43e2-bb0a-883fc391b17d" eId="art_2__para_2__para_c__qstr" endQuote="”" startQuote="“" ukl:context="body" ukl:docName="uksi" ukl:indent="indent0">
									<level GUID="_d292ea29-cd27-4f20-9c7a-211365dc498c" class="para2" eId="art_2__para_2__para_c__qstr__subpara_d">
										<num ukl:autonumber="no">(d)</num>
										<content>
											<p>controlled pipelines (except those described under sub-paragraph (b) or (c)) used in relation to the conveyance of hydrogen.</p>
										</content>
									</level>
									</quotedStructure><inline name="AppendText">; and</inline></mod> </p>
							</content>
						</level>
						<level GUID="_c343fd2a-ae37-461c-8492-c93052347ee9" class="para1" eId="art_2__para_2__para_d">
							<num>(d)</num>
							<content>
								<p>in paragraph (3) in the definition of “relevant substances” for “ or carbon dioxide” substitute “, carbon dioxide or hydrogen”.</p>
							</content>
						</level>
					</paragraph>
				</article>
			</part>
			<part GUID="_6930f4ca-7881-4bbd-94ee-b54f4aa3c126" class="group2" eId="pt_3">
				<?DMS-Component componentId="6051ce51-12f5-4bb7-840e-9cb65d52544b" seriesId="1241f691-baef-4f67-aade-81f133861d1e" versionNumber="0"?>
				<num>Part 3</num>
				<heading GUID="_e404c785-e5f7-4dd8-bf9b-903cc3ebedd9" eId="pt_3__hdg">Gas</heading>
				<article GUID="_801adde2-be84-431a-a365-a9c0e72d34fe" class="prov1" eId="art_3">
					<?DMS-Component componentId="b9fd8973-8883-4fc1-ba45-9b9e8778b51d" seriesId="f3c0d838-1fef-4aa4-9bf9-7ac77d5f138a" versionNumber="0"?>
					<heading GUID="_b0e4a626-5dc2-4d0f-8ba7-a2d2b107dbe4" eId="art_3__hdg">Designation of substance</heading>
					<num>3.</num>
					<content>
						<p>Hydrogen is designated as a substance for the purposes of section 2(4)(e) of the Energy Act 2008<authorialNote GUID="_770bdfe0-9e18-4ad9-a78d-d1b2ac1e3701" class="footnote" eId="fnote_5" marker="5">
							<p>2008 c. 32.</p>
							</authorialNote> (Prohibition on unlicensed activities).</p>
					</content>
				</article>
				<article GUID="_d69e1c5d-2935-4986-979e-918722bc65a5" class="prov1" eId="art_4">
					<?DMS-Component componentId="6eb55c37-3eb1-4c41-80c1-60afedd1cb56" seriesId="c946e50a-36cd-440a-8726-7b5915c3fd5a" versionNumber="0"?>
					<heading GUID="_a673db53-da71-4edf-8da3-0a3ef06e5745" eId="art_4__hdg">Amendment to The Offshore Gas Storage and Unloading (Licensing) Regulations 2009</heading>
					<num>4.</num>
					<paragraph GUID="_4f97bb6d-e4d8-43ed-86f8-51ef71678e52" class="prov2" eId="art_4__para_1">
						<num>(1)</num>
						<content>
							<p>The Offshore Gas Storage and Unloading (Licensing) Regulations 2009<authorialNote GUID="_8af88639-caad-44fd-bdc9-851fd7e12240" class="footnote" eId="fnote_6" marker="6">
								<p>S.I. 2009/2813.</p>
								</authorialNote> are amended as follows.</p>
						</content>
					</paragraph>
					<paragraph GUID="_7b0c7802-269f-4ece-8c3a-e791d4fcd426" class="prov2" eId="art_4__para_2">
						<num>(2)</num>
						<content>
							<p>In the Schedule, in paragraph 1 (Interpretation etc.), in the definition of “gas” for “or butane” substitute “butane or hydrogen”.</p>
						</content>
					</paragraph>
				</article>
			</part>
